---
{
  title: "percent_of"
}
---
### NAME

    percent_of() - Calculates what `a%` of `b` is.

### SYNOPSIS

    float percent_of( float a, float b );

### DESCRIPTION

    Calculates what `a%` of `b` is.

### PARAMETERS

    a  (float)
       The percentage value.

    b  (float)
       The whole value.

### RETURN VALUES

    (float) The value that is `a` percent of `b`.
